  "cmd_full_name": "aidge merchandise-placement-detection-lite",
  "cmd_name": "merchandise-placement-detection-lite",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Detects product displays in photos of shelves, endcaps, freezers, display tables, and dump bins by using product SKU recognition and multimodal large model grounding. It aggregates product locations by SKU and supplements the results with visible single-item grounding and short names to facilitate product location display, display inventory, and subsequent distribution verification in business systems",
  "description_zh": "基于商品 SKU 识别与多模态大模型定位构建的轻量陈列检测产品，面向货架、端架、冰柜、陈列台和堆头照片。产品按 SKU 汇总商品位置，并补充可见单品定位与短名称，便于业务系统开展商品位置展示、陈列盘点和后续铺货核验",
  "kebab_example": "",
  "method": "POST",
  "multi_version": false,
  "name": "MerchandisePlacementDetectionLite",
